WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.425
So, four decisions.

2
00:00:01.425 --> 00:00:04.453
Name the owners in writing,
with signed appointments

3
00:00:04.453 --> 00:00:07.550
and the authorizing official
selecting the assessor.

4
00:00:07.550 --> 00:00:11.699
Keep one dated clock: submit
the post-quantum migration plan,

5
00:00:11.699 --> 00:00:16.013
and re-check every federal date
against its source at each gate.

6
00:00:16.013 --> 00:00:20.475
Fund the mechanisms that produce records
before the tools that measure them,

7
00:00:20.475 --> 00:00:24.450
because assessment tools confirm a
design; they can't stand in for one.

8
00:00:24.450 --> 00:00:28.214
And generate the package, with
a disposition on every failing

9
00:00:28.214 --> 00:00:32.125
item and a named reviewer for
every provider's quarterly report.

10
00:00:32.125 --> 00:00:34.325
The next step needs no procurement.

11
00:00:34.325 --> 00:00:38.962
Fill in the product inventory questionnaire
against the estate as it is today,

12
00:00:38.962 --> 00:00:42.387
and settle every flag before
the security plan is written.

13
00:00:42.387 --> 00:00:44.826
A promise is true on the day it's signed.

14
00:00:44.826 --> 00:00:46.550
Proof keeps showing itself.

15
00:00:46.550 --> 00:00:50.625
Book 14 has the detail,
with every claim footnoted.

16
00:00:50.625 --> 00:00:51.460
Thank you.
